MODULE: AdmissionProjectsOldEqualBytes
TARGET: ProjectionMonotone
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: An equal-byte superseded prepare replaces a timestamp-sensitive newer projection
PERTURBS: Publish

--- FIND
        [k \in Keys |-> IF classes[k] = "prepared" THEN Prepared[k] ELSE value[k]]
--- REPLACE
        [k \in Keys |-> IF sampled[k].bytes = Prepared[k].bytes THEN Prepared[k] ELSE value[k]]
--- END
